      "text": "1\nQualityTrace\nLevel 1\nMage\nDPS\n0\n0 fps\n2 ms\nHearthmere\nChannel 1\nNormal\nN\nWelcome to Hearthfall, QualityTrace.\n134\nAUTO\n1\n2\n3\n4\nSPACE\n100\nE\nUse Waypoint\nSETTINGS\nSound, comfort & controls\nSOUND & COMFORT\nCONTROLS\nSOUND\nMaster volume\n80%\nMute all sound\nEffects\n100%\nAmbience\n100%\nCAMERA\nCamera shake\n\nShake from impacts can be turned off. Your view distance stays the same.\n\nEFFECTS\nReduce flashes\n\nHide hit flashes and level-up bursts. Steady particle flicker and warning pulses. Spell effects and attack warnings remain visible.\n\nShow loot quality\n\nAdd written rarity and Ancient/Primal labels to items on the ground. Item colours stay the same.\n\nSettings are remembered in this browser.\n\nRESTORE DEFAULTS",
